fset. Only the list's own scrolls are counted (`depth == 0`) |","+","+## Design notes","+- **Event volume / PostHog free tier.** The obvious hook, `onChanged`, would send","+  an event for every keystroke and for every slider step crossed during a drag,","+  and every scroll update would send one too. That can use up the","+  per-event-billed free quota very quickly. Events fire on the first edit, on","+  `onChangeEnd` and on `ScrollEndNotification` instead. The worklore story","+  \"PostHog free tier gone in days? Flutter sent an event per keystroke\" describes","+  this exact problem and fix. I used it as a reference only and reported","+  nothing back to the service, per the ground rules.","+- **No PII.** Email and phone values are never sent as properties.","+- No screen-view events were added, because `PosthogObserver` already tracks them.","+- `amount` is sent as `int` (`_amount.round()`), as the spec asks.","+","+## Verification","+- `dart format` and `flutter analyze`: no issues.","+- Not run on a device. To check by hand, set `config.debug = true` in","+  `Analytics.init` and confirm that typing an email logs one","+  `registration_email_started` and a full slider drag logs one","+  `loan_amount_changed`.","+","+## Side note (not changed)","+`README.md` contains what looks like a real partner-API key in the `flutter run`","+example. Consider removing it from the README and rotating it."]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-jIBR96/analysis_options.yaml","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":10,"newStart":1,"newLines":1,"lines":["-analyzer:","-  exclude:","-    - build/**","-    - android/**","-    - ios/**","-    - web/**","-    - windows/**","-    - macos/**","-    - linux/**"," include: package:flutter_lints/flutter.yaml"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/private/tmp/h-jIBR96/ANSWER.md","/private/tmp/h-jIBR96/analysis_options.yaml"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HedRZmDbGCc1wL8fNqSYTF","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"co